# Flutter/Dart build outputs
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/gradle/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/app/build/

# iOS/macOS build outputs
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Pods/

# Windows/Linux build outputs
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/

# Example app builds (if exists)
**/example/build/
**/example/.dart_tool/
**/example/android/.gradle/
**/example/android/app/build/
**/example/ios/Pods/
**/example/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/example/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/example/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# Large binary files
**/*.pdb
**/*.dll.lib
**/*.exe
**/*.so
**/*.dylib

# Generated files
**/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.metadata
**/pubspec.lock
